[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Open the ashtray and undo the screws.</p><p>2. Move the ashtray over slightly.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections (3a, 3b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Ashtray light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236060\">G35</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3B</p></td><td><p>Cigar lighter / current socket</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237282\">P50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019531.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>1. If necessary, close the ashtray flap and extract the bulb holder.</p><p>2. Extract the bulb from the bulb holder. (Press fit)</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019532.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the ashtray is undamaged.</p><p>If removed, fit the bulb and the bulb holder.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Fit ashtray in its seating.</p><p>Tighten the screws.</p><p>Check that the cigar lighter, the bulb\nand the ashtray light bulb are working properly.</p>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Open the ashtray.</p><p>2. Unscrew the bolts</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019533.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,0,"<p>1. Withdraw the ashtray.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Cigar lighter / current socket</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237282\">P50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019534.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the ashtray is undamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Place the ashtray in position and tighten\nthe bolts.</p>"]]